dr_libs - single-file audio decoding libraries by David Reid (mackron)
https://github.com/mackron/dr_libs

Copied here, unchanged:
  dr_mp3.h  v0.7.4   (MP3 decoder, based on minimp3)
  dr_wav.h  v0.14.6  (WAV/AIFF reader)
