Pinned to commit 35b5c392cc15456736c440a68dbe073178bbffe0 (2026-10-30,
"dr_wav: Version 0.14.6").

dr_libs.c is larperCord's: it compiles the two headers with only what the audio
player needs (no stdio) and exposes a few plain functions for Zig
(src/core/audio_pcm.zig).
